%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"background":"#FFFEF9","fontFamily":"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif","fontSize":"14px","lineColor":"#222","primaryTextColor":"#111"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor I as Interviewer
  participant C as CLI / API
  participant U as Ask use case
  participant R as Retriever
  participant G as Guardrails (code)
  participant M as ModelPort
  participant P as Provider
  participant T as TraceSink
  I->>C: question
  C->>U: ask(question)
  Note over C,U: production only: rate limit (429 if over)
  U->>R: retrieve(question)
  R-->>U: Entries + role headers + Conflict sides
  U->>G: Input Guardrail(scores)
  alt no Entry above floor
    G-->>I: "That isn't in my sources."
  else
    U->>M: generate(prompt, Entries)
    Note over M,P: timeout · production: retry once on 429/5xx, circuit breaker
    M->>P: one call, temperature 0
    P-->>M: {claims[], notInSources}
    alt timeout / error / bad JSON
      M-->>I: "The assistant can't answer right now."
    else
      M-->>U: claims
      U->>G: Output Guardrail(claims, Entries)
      G-->>U: kept, dropped
      U->>G: render Conflicts (if relevant)
      U-->>C: answer, sources, removed count
      C-->>I: answer with citations
    end
  end
  U->>T: trace record
